    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1511" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁδρ-ύνω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁδρός</span>)
